{"id":"vod_bf_14903","vodId":"14903","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","name_cn":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第293集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/624037ffb6b9e1c57c66f8d58d2c833e.jpg"},"summary":"随着和平的到来而走向近代化的木叶忍者村。高楼林立，巨大显示屏中播放出影像，连结各区域的电车在村里奔驰。虽说是忍者村，但一般民众也增多，忍者的生存方式也在逐渐改变的这个时代——　　村子的领袖，第七代火影·漩涡鸣人的儿子慕留人，进入了培育忍者的学校“忍者学校”。周围的学生们带着“火影的儿子”这样偏见的目光看待慕留人，但慕留人凭借天生的破天荒性格将这种小事轻松越过！　　慕留人与新的伙伴相遇，他将如何挑战突然发生的神秘事件？　　在众人心中如疾风般狂奔的“漩涡慕留人”的物语，现在开始！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,冒险,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:17:16","classic":true,"classicRank":35,"franchise":"火影忍者","playable":true,"episodeCount":293,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huoyingrenzheborenchuanzhicishidaijichengzhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},